Microsoft Power~BI{} dashboards can be styled with \TeX. Such business 
intelligence dashboards can be displayed online via the Power~BI{} Service, or 
offline in the Power~BI{} Desktop application. This versatility can be 
implemented via Mathtext, a lightweight \TeX\ parser embedded in Python's 
Matplotlib library. Power~BI{}'s \TeX\ presentation capabilities are explored 
here with an example dashboard. Links to supporting file resources are 
supplied.
